      "claim": "Belvarafenib, a structurally related aminoheteroaryl amide kinase inhibitor with a halogenated aniline, achieved brain concentrations comparable to or exceeding blood after oral dosing in mice and rats, supporting meaningful CNS access for the query's similar scaffold.",
